01:00:44.000 --> 01:00:49.000
They went late at night so that the area looked exactly as Allison remembered it. She removed the bloodstained garments and other items then piled them on the ground. With her husband's help, Allison set fire to the belongings. As she watched them burn and then eventually saw the flames die out, Allison felt a sense of relief. Thanks for watching! There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
